<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH CNB-120 INDEX FALLS 4.9 POINTS TO 757.8 PTS.</title>
<headline>CZECH CNB-120 INDEX FALLS 4.9 POINTS TO 757.8 PTS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, fell 4.9 points, or 0.64 percent, on Tuesday to 757.8, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Six of the ten sectoral indices lost, with the energy index losing the most, down 21.2 points, or 2.37 percent, to 873.9 points.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
